WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:35.940
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.210 --> 01:40.070
[River of No Return]

3
01:40.100 --> 01:43.000
[Episode 2: The Crown Prince and the Constable]

4
01:44.370 --> 01:46.240
You've got quite a temper, don't you?

5
01:46.240 --> 01:47.500
Refusing to talk, huh?

6
01:52.630 --> 01:53.830
Let me put it this way.

7
01:53.979 --> 01:55.580
If I take you to the yamen now,

8
01:55.780 --> 01:58.110
and say you're the one who blew up the boat,

9
01:58.710 --> 02:00.060
you'll get the death penalty.

10
02:00.060 --> 02:01.120
Do you understand?

11
02:06.570 --> 02:07.520
Playing dead

12
02:07.620 --> 02:09.880
and giving me the silent treatment, huh?

13
02:09.910 --> 02:10.910
Fine. Come on.

14
02:17.980 --> 02:19.380
It's a piece of fine jade.

15
02:20.510 --> 02:21.840
"Accurate to the inch"?

16
02:21.910 --> 02:22.910
What does it mean?

17
02:25.950 --> 02:27.410
Why are you laughing at me?

18
02:28.000 --> 02:30.600
Don't you Jinling constables ever read a book?

19
02:31.730 --> 02:32.880
Cut the crap.

20
02:34.700 --> 02:35.210
Go!

21
02:35.400 --> 02:36.380
♪ Along the Qinhuai River in Nanjing ♪

22
02:36.380 --> 02:36.790
[Zhengyang Gate]

23
02:36.790 --> 02:38.290
♪ I patrol the streets, swaying along day after day ♪

24
02:38.350 --> 02:39.579
♪ A jug of wine in hand, a blade of grass between my teeth ♪

25
02:39.610 --> 02:41.050
♪ Even the rowdiest ghosts run when they see me ♪

26
02:41.110 --> 02:41.790
♪ Don't ask me what I'm after ♪

27
02:41.790 --> 02:42.480
Lift your feet!

28
02:42.480 --> 02:43.140
♪ Honestly, I don't even know ♪

29
02:43.140 --> 02:43.960
You'll break your neck.

30
02:43.960 --> 02:45.090
♪ All I know is, there are some things ♪

31
02:45.110 --> 02:46.560
♪ I'd feel guilty if I didn't do ♪

32
02:46.579 --> 02:48.030
♪ I'm not cut out to be an official ♪

33
02:48.060 --> 02:49.490
♪ Nor am I one for playing tricks ♪

34
02:49.520 --> 02:50.840
♪ When it's time to act, I act ♪

35
02:50.860 --> 02:52.210
♪ I play it straight, no funny business ♪

36
02:55.850 --> 02:56.790
Hurry up.

37
03:01.140 --> 03:02.400
What's your business?

38
03:02.490 --> 03:03.970
I'm from the Yingtian Prefectural Office.

39
03:03.970 --> 03:05.510
I'm taking a prisoner into the city.

40
03:05.510 --> 03:06.570
Take another gate.

41
03:06.910 --> 03:07.950
This gate's unsafe.

42
03:07.950 --> 03:09.080
No one gets through.

43
03:09.580 --> 03:10.310
Unsafe?

44
03:12.010 --> 03:12.790
No way.

45
03:12.880 --> 03:15.150
This prisoner must be delivered into custody immediately.

46
03:15.150 --> 03:16.060
No delays.

47
03:16.200 --> 03:18.760
Are you deaf or what?

48
03:20.470 --> 03:21.790
Let me tell you,

49
03:22.600 --> 03:26.329
he may be a suspect in the Crown Prince's attempted assassination.

50
03:26.640 --> 03:27.290
Can you

51
03:27.700 --> 03:29.160
take the responsibility?

52
03:29.540 --> 03:31.100
Let me make it clear first.

53
03:31.450 --> 03:33.310
You insisted on passing through.

54
03:33.329 --> 03:35.390
Don't blame me if something happens!

55
03:36.980 --> 03:38.380
Something happens to me?

56
03:39.040 --> 03:41.100
I'm afraid nothing will happen to me.

57
03:42.600 --> 03:43.750
Are you scared?

58
03:45.970 --> 03:46.900
He's not scared.

59
03:47.230 --> 03:47.910
It's fine.

60
03:49.140 --> 03:49.630
Go.

61
03:55.090 --> 03:55.579
Go.

62
04:15.970 --> 04:17.310
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

63
04:17.339 --> 04:18.630
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

64
04:18.649 --> 04:20.160
♪ Swaying along— what's all the swaying for? ♪

65
04:20.230 --> 04:21.410
Did I say you could go?

66
04:21.410 --> 04:22.650
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

67
04:22.730 --> 04:22.780
Haven't you had enough of a beating?

68
04:22.780 --> 04:24.020
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

69
04:24.040 --> 04:26.270
♪ Chasing them down— what am I chasing for? ♪

70
04:26.860 --> 04:28.450
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

71
04:28.480 --> 04:28.720
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

72
04:28.720 --> 04:29.220
Move.

73
04:29.990 --> 04:31.690
♪ Who knows where home is? ♪

74
04:32.520 --> 04:33.960
♪ To hell with princes and nobles ♪

75
04:34.000 --> 04:35.390
♪ To hell with what the history books say ♪

76
04:35.420 --> 04:37.330
♪ I'm my own guardian angel ♪

77
04:48.690 --> 04:49.780
Behave yourself.

78
04:53.670 --> 04:54.340
[Wu Yulu, Wu Buping's daughter]

79
04:54.340 --> 04:54.940
Dingyuan.

80
04:55.960 --> 04:56.560
Dingyuan!

81
04:59.020 --> 04:59.620
Dingyuan!

82
05:00.220 --> 05:00.780
Yulu?

83
05:01.400 --> 05:02.260
Stop there!

84
05:02.760 --> 05:03.580
Why are you here?

85
05:03.580 --> 05:04.970
Father sent someone home to look for you.

86
05:04.970 --> 05:06.510
They said you weren't at Shangutai.

87
05:06.510 --> 05:07.720
The treasure ship was blown up

88
05:07.720 --> 05:09.720
and he was worried you might be hurt.

89
05:11.170 --> 05:13.320
I was investigating the case with Father that morning.

90
05:13.320 --> 05:15.260
That room was full of gunpowder,

91
05:15.310 --> 05:16.770
but it didn't even hurt me.

92
05:17.020 --> 05:18.110
Behave yourself.

93
05:19.490 --> 05:20.470
It was half a river away.

94
05:20.470 --> 05:21.860
How could it hurt me?

95
05:22.050 --> 05:23.510
I‘m lucky.

96
05:25.320 --> 05:25.850
Brother,

97
05:26.690 --> 05:27.380
Who is this?

98
05:28.640 --> 05:29.630
This guy

99
05:31.350 --> 05:34.210
has something to do with the explosion of the Crown Prince's treasure ship.

100
05:34.210 --> 05:36.840
I'm taking him to the Yingtian Prefectural Office now.

101
05:36.840 --> 05:38.340
Father sent word

102
05:38.870 --> 05:40.360
that all the officials from Yingtian Prefecture

103
05:40.360 --> 05:42.170
were wiped out at Dongshuiguan.

104
05:42.500 --> 05:44.870
If no one's at the Yingtian Prefectural Office,

105
05:44.870 --> 05:46.930
I'll take him to the Imperial Guards.

106
05:47.070 --> 05:49.270
Maybe I'll even pocket a little reward.

107
05:49.780 --> 05:50.340
Alright.

108
05:50.520 --> 05:51.300
It's a mess outside.

109
05:51.300 --> 05:52.000
Go home now.

110
05:52.820 --> 05:53.460
Okay.

111
05:55.280 --> 05:55.820
Let's go.

112
06:00.050 --> 06:00.870
Go.

113
06:03.140 --> 06:03.900
I'll kick you.

114
06:03.900 --> 06:04.220
The court is in crisis,

115
06:04.220 --> 06:05.490
[Imperial Guards Headquarters]

116
06:05.490 --> 06:06.960
and you dare turn a blind eye?

117
06:06.960 --> 06:08.130
We're on our way to help the victims now.

118
06:08.130 --> 06:10.390
The Imperial Guards' duty isn't rescue.

119
06:10.670 --> 06:13.030
It's to track down the culprits as quickly as possible!

120
06:13.030 --> 06:13.700
If

121
06:14.120 --> 06:14.530
you delay us,

122
06:14.530 --> 06:15.720
[Yu Qian, Director of Messenger's Office]

123
06:15.720 --> 06:16.770
every one of you

124
06:17.630 --> 06:19.090
will be guilty of treason!

125
06:19.870 --> 06:22.430
You're just a lowly Messenger Director from the Messenger's Office,

126
06:22.430 --> 06:24.430
yet you talk like a grand secretary,

127
06:24.460 --> 06:26.250
coming here to tell us what to do!

128
06:26.250 --> 06:28.580
I'm Wu Dingyuan, a constable with the Yingtian Prefecture.

129
06:28.580 --> 06:30.110
I caught one suspect

130
06:30.190 --> 06:31.400
at the scene of the Crown Prince's ship explosion,

131
06:31.400 --> 06:33.000
and I'm here to hand him over.

132
06:38.550 --> 06:39.100
Wait.

133
06:41.930 --> 06:43.700
Why do you have this jade pendant?

134
06:43.700 --> 06:44.960
Don't touch my things.

135
06:46.600 --> 06:48.140
This can't be yours.

136
06:55.020 --> 06:56.420
Did you steal it or rob it?

137
06:56.720 --> 06:57.580
Tell the truth.

138
07:08.400 --> 07:10.820
I found it on this punk.

139
07:12.580 --> 07:13.310
Give it to me.

140
07:22.930 --> 07:23.780
Hurry up.

141
07:24.510 --> 07:25.380
Brother Shen.

142
07:28.580 --> 07:30.070
I am Yu Qian, Yu Tingyi.

143
07:36.350 --> 07:39.170
Since you took the high position as a subordinate of the Crown Prince

144
07:39.170 --> 07:40.260
to assist the Eastern Palace,

145
07:40.260 --> 07:41.990
we haven't seen each other for years.

146
07:41.990 --> 07:43.390
Do you still remember me?

147
07:48.060 --> 07:49.860
Do you two know each other or not?

148
07:50.100 --> 07:51.760
Don't put on a show for me here.

149
07:53.380 --> 07:54.580
Of course I remember.

150
07:54.990 --> 07:56.790
Where is Zheng He, Zheng Sanbao?

151
08:03.630 --> 08:06.260
Go report to the Garrison Eunuch, Lord Zheng He, immediately.

152
08:06.260 --> 08:06.950
Tell him

153
08:07.810 --> 08:10.580
that Shen Lian, the Crown Prince's subordinate, has been found,

154
08:10.580 --> 08:12.510
and ask him to come meet him at once.

155
08:27.190 --> 08:28.120
Arrest this man!

156
08:31.020 --> 08:31.490
Brothers,

157
08:31.490 --> 08:32.909
I'm just here to hand over a prisoner!

158
08:32.909 --> 08:34.080
You've got the wrong man!

159
08:34.080 --> 08:35.860
I'm just here to hand over a prisoner!

160
08:35.860 --> 08:37.260
You've got the wrong man!

161
08:41.169 --> 08:43.150
How did you know my identity?

162
08:44.430 --> 08:45.290
Your Highness,

163
08:45.910 --> 08:48.530
I passed the imperial examinations in the 19th year of the Yongle reign.

164
08:48.530 --> 08:51.550
I saw Emperor Taizong during the palace examination.

165
08:52.340 --> 08:53.670
You and Emperor Taizong

166
08:53.810 --> 08:55.220
look exactly alike.

167
08:56.860 --> 08:58.740
The four characters on that jade pendant...

168
08:58.740 --> 09:00.200
I also know their meaning.

169
09:00.840 --> 09:01.580
Besides,

170
09:01.980 --> 09:04.190
no one in Jinling City

171
09:04.810 --> 09:06.740
who can call Lord Zheng by his name.

172
09:08.550 --> 09:09.580
I heard

173
09:10.460 --> 09:14.150
that the officials welcoming me at Dongshui Pass are either dead or injured.

174
09:14.150 --> 09:16.220
Is Zheng He still safe?

175
09:16.820 --> 09:18.070
When the incident happened, his guards

176
09:18.070 --> 09:19.470
all stood in front of him,

177
09:19.670 --> 09:20.620
so Lord Zheng

178
09:20.840 --> 09:22.370
didn't suffer much impact.

179
09:22.430 --> 09:23.430
I was not far away,

180
09:23.670 --> 09:25.340
so I saw it with my own eyes.

181
09:27.360 --> 09:28.190
Go on.

182
09:30.690 --> 09:31.550
Your Highness,

183
09:32.620 --> 09:33.580
I believe

184
09:34.000 --> 09:35.790
at this treacherous time,

185
09:36.430 --> 09:39.070
the only person in Jinling City

186
09:39.970 --> 09:41.330
is Lord Zheng.

187
09:53.030 --> 09:54.390
Do you know that man,

188
09:55.070 --> 09:55.910
Wu Dingyuan?

189
09:57.170 --> 09:58.070
I do.

190
09:59.100 --> 10:00.150
He has a nickname,

191
10:00.620 --> 10:01.880
"Good-for-nothing".

192
10:02.080 --> 10:03.840
He's useless, a man who'll never amount to anything.

193
10:03.840 --> 10:05.290
Without his father's influence,

194
10:05.290 --> 10:08.620
he'd never have become a constable in Yingtian Prefecture.

195
10:09.820 --> 10:11.480
The one with a real reputation

196
10:11.860 --> 10:13.290
is his father, "Iron Lion"

197
10:13.290 --> 10:15.310
Wu Buping, chief constable overseeing

198
10:15.310 --> 10:18.040
all three divisions of the Yingtian Prefecture.

199
10:23.740 --> 10:24.310
Come.

200
10:25.650 --> 10:26.670
Raise your head.

201
10:34.950 --> 10:36.550
Go do something for me.

202
10:39.150 --> 10:40.210
Do you understand?

203
10:51.790 --> 10:53.600
"Accurate to the inch"?

204
10:54.360 --> 10:55.440
It's a piece of good jade.

205
10:55.440 --> 10:56.600
♪ Along the Qinhuai River in Nanjing ♪

206
10:56.600 --> 10:56.870
This can't be yours.

207
10:56.870 --> 10:58.550
♪ I patrol the streets, swaying along day after day ♪

208
10:58.550 --> 10:58.620
Since you took the high position as a subordinate of the Crown Prince

209
10:58.620 --> 11:00.340
♪ A jug of wine in hand, a blade of grass between my teeth ♪

210
11:00.430 --> 11:01.310
♪ Even the rowdiest ghosts run when they see me ♪

211
11:01.310 --> 11:02.120
and began serving the Eastern Palace,

212
11:02.120 --> 11:02.910
♪ Through storms and flames, I press on ♪

213
11:02.910 --> 11:03.650
we haven't seen each other for years.

214
11:03.650 --> 11:05.390
♪ I drag my life along like a rope ♪

215
11:05.410 --> 11:05.500
♪ They call me a young constable ♪

216
11:05.500 --> 11:06.900
Do you still remember me?

217
11:07.030 --> 11:07.100
Of course I do.

218
11:07.100 --> 11:08.600
♪ But this realm isn't mine to rule ♪

219
11:08.600 --> 11:10.000
Where is Zheng He, Zheng Sanbao?

220
11:10.000 --> 11:11.530
♪ Isn't mine to rule ♪

221
11:13.670 --> 11:15.030
No way.

222
11:15.870 --> 11:18.000
Did I really run into the Crown Prince?

223
11:29.360 --> 11:30.090
Wu Dingyuan,

224
11:30.240 --> 11:32.290
you were at the scene when the treasure ship exploded.

225
11:32.290 --> 11:33.700
Tell us what you know.

226
11:34.960 --> 11:36.820
How are you connected to the case?

227
11:37.270 --> 11:38.740
What are you asking me?

228
11:39.100 --> 11:40.220
I don't understand.

229
11:40.220 --> 11:41.480
How can I answer you?

230
11:41.600 --> 11:42.930
Don't play dumb with me.

231
11:43.200 --> 11:44.630
The current situation is critical,

232
11:44.630 --> 11:46.230
and people are losing heart.

233
11:46.670 --> 11:47.320
Let me tell you,

234
11:47.320 --> 11:48.480
anyone who serves the state

235
11:48.480 --> 11:50.600
has a duty to step up in times of crisis and help those in danger.

236
11:50.600 --> 11:52.050
Spare me

237
11:52.050 --> 11:53.700
the grand speeches.

238
11:54.530 --> 11:55.430
Save that stuff

239
11:55.960 --> 11:57.860
for the bigwigs at court.

240
11:58.070 --> 11:59.000
I don't understand it,

241
11:59.000 --> 12:00.310
and I don't care to.

242
12:00.840 --> 12:02.930
For me, there are only two things that matters:

243
12:02.930 --> 12:03.860
staying alive

244
12:04.080 --> 12:05.080
and making money.

245
12:14.070 --> 12:14.820
Alright.

246
12:16.030 --> 12:17.430
If you want to stay alive,

247
12:18.260 --> 12:20.790
you should answer the questions truthfully.

248
12:29.410 --> 12:30.410
My two lords,

249
12:33.530 --> 12:34.620
do you two

250
12:35.820 --> 12:37.720
really take me for a fool?

251
12:38.390 --> 12:40.320
With such a big commotion outside,

252
12:40.480 --> 12:43.570
do you really think our Yingtian Prefectural Office can handle it?

253
12:43.570 --> 12:45.620
Do you really want the Yingtian Prefectural Office

254
12:45.620 --> 12:47.570
and my father to take the blame?

255
12:48.530 --> 12:49.790
What are you thinking?

256
12:49.940 --> 12:51.100
Is it that easy?

257
12:51.450 --> 12:52.180
Wu Dingyuan,

258
12:53.320 --> 12:55.290
you are the son of Iron Lion after all.

259
12:55.290 --> 12:57.340
How can you disgrace your father like this?

260
12:57.340 --> 12:59.650
Since you witnessed the bombing,

261
13:00.500 --> 13:01.580
and you're a constable.

262
13:01.580 --> 13:03.700
It's your duty to help us find out

263
13:03.790 --> 13:06.220
who's behind the attempt on the Crown Prince's life.

264
13:06.220 --> 13:07.580
I have that duty, too?

265
13:08.670 --> 13:09.870
Answer the question!

266
13:10.310 --> 13:11.430
What happened

267
13:11.460 --> 13:12.860
to the Huliu explosive stolen from the palace?

268
13:12.860 --> 13:14.390
You ask me. Who should I ask?

269
13:14.450 --> 13:15.390
I have no idea.

270
13:15.720 --> 13:16.270
You...

271
13:19.630 --> 13:22.360
Can I ask you two a question first?

272
13:25.960 --> 13:27.020
Is the Crown Prince

273
13:27.240 --> 13:28.030
still alive?

274
13:37.860 --> 13:38.790
I think

275
13:39.600 --> 13:41.200
if you two really want to know

276
13:41.500 --> 13:42.740
who this thief is,

277
13:43.720 --> 13:45.250
find out who's behind this,

278
13:46.090 --> 13:48.610
just handle it the way

279
13:48.910 --> 13:50.440
the Crown Prince would have

280
13:50.600 --> 13:52.000
while he was still alive.

281
13:52.050 --> 13:52.670
Get it?

282
14:03.180 --> 14:04.490
Release me quickly!

283
14:04.820 --> 14:06.500
You will definitely need me.

284
14:07.240 --> 14:08.580
The day is not over yet.

285
14:22.620 --> 14:23.950
Greetings, Lord Zheng.

286
14:25.340 --> 14:27.190
Master Shen, the one and only master of focus and integrity,

287
14:27.190 --> 14:28.250
is waiting inside.

288
14:51.890 --> 14:52.600
I, Zheng He,

289
14:53.170 --> 14:54.820
the eunuch in charge of Jinling's defenses,

290
14:54.820 --> 14:56.680
pay my respects to Your Highness.

291
15:10.840 --> 15:11.790
Sanbao,

292
15:14.090 --> 15:15.800
I finally see you.

293
15:21.150 --> 15:22.210
Stand up and speak.

294
15:25.750 --> 15:26.910
I am late.

295
15:27.260 --> 15:29.530
I failed to protect Your Highness.

296
15:30.260 --> 15:32.640
I deserve to die.

297
15:35.420 --> 15:36.800
You are a grown man.

298
15:37.890 --> 15:39.220
Why are you crying?

299
15:40.450 --> 15:41.100
Look.

300
15:41.790 --> 15:43.100
I am perfectly fine,

301
15:44.390 --> 15:45.460
aren't I?

302
15:50.410 --> 15:53.340
It's just that the Huliu explosive is very powerful.

303
15:53.500 --> 15:54.270
Sanbao,

304
15:55.860 --> 15:57.320
you are not injured at all.

305
15:58.580 --> 16:00.860
Although I suffered some impact,

306
16:00.860 --> 16:01.950
I am fine.

307
16:02.080 --> 16:02.940
Your Highness,

308
16:02.980 --> 16:04.440
please allow me to report.

309
16:05.430 --> 16:07.360
The rebels bombed my treasure ship

310
16:08.820 --> 16:10.750
with Huliu explosive, do you know?

311
16:11.810 --> 16:12.580
I know.

312
16:12.840 --> 16:14.820
And do you know

313
16:15.100 --> 16:16.100
where they got it?

314
16:16.910 --> 16:19.190
A few days ago, in Jinling Palace,

315
16:19.210 --> 16:21.610
a batch of Huliu explosive was indeed lost.

316
16:32.730 --> 16:34.220
Jinling. Jinling.

317
16:38.400 --> 16:40.210
Jinling is really something.

318
16:43.340 --> 16:45.070
I haven't even set foot ashore,

319
16:45.620 --> 16:48.150
and they've already dealt me such a blow.

320
16:48.450 --> 16:49.790
It was my negligence.

321
16:50.150 --> 16:50.700
I...

322
16:57.550 --> 16:58.100
Alright.

323
16:58.620 --> 17:00.340
Don't blame yourself anymore.

324
17:00.340 --> 17:02.140
Since you are unharmed, Sanbao,

325
17:02.950 --> 17:04.150
that's the best.

326
17:11.910 --> 17:13.430
The culprits won't stop

327
17:13.690 --> 17:15.430
until they see me dead.

328
17:15.890 --> 17:18.040
We can't even be sure there aren't spies

329
17:18.040 --> 17:20.390
among the Imperial Guards.

330
17:21.260 --> 17:22.119
Your Highness,

331
17:23.240 --> 17:23.950
earlier,

332
17:24.280 --> 17:27.220
I discussed this with Zhu Buhua, the eunuch overseeing the Imperial Stables.

333
17:27.220 --> 17:29.150
We agreed to guard separate locations.

334
17:29.150 --> 17:31.390
He's keeping cavalry from the Brave Warriors Camp stationed at the Imperial City

335
17:31.390 --> 17:32.520
in case of emergency.

336
17:32.520 --> 17:33.190
He should

337
17:33.950 --> 17:37.480
send someone to escort Your Highness back to the palace safely.

338
17:39.280 --> 17:39.950
Sanbao,

339
17:40.630 --> 17:42.490
How long have you been in Jinling?

340
17:43.350 --> 17:44.550
Less than half a year.

341
17:45.650 --> 17:46.850
Less than half a year?

342
17:47.520 --> 17:48.350
Then tell me,

343
17:48.430 --> 17:49.670
where is safe

344
17:50.170 --> 17:51.780
in this city?

345
17:56.170 --> 17:57.020
I know

346
17:58.190 --> 18:00.320
this matter has nothing to do with you.

347
18:01.910 --> 18:03.020
You just said

348
18:03.430 --> 18:05.700
you want to escort me back to the Imperial Palace, right?

349
18:05.700 --> 18:06.300
Yes.

350
18:07.780 --> 18:09.510
Arrange it as soon as possible.

351
18:11.300 --> 18:12.540
I want to see

352
18:13.300 --> 18:15.590
who wants to kill me so badly.

353
18:23.590 --> 18:25.060
Emperor Taizong above,

354
18:25.480 --> 18:26.950
I, Tuotuo Buhua,

355
18:27.280 --> 18:31.140
was granted the surname Zhu by Emperor Taizong to serve in the palace.

356
18:31.760 --> 18:33.390
Now His Highness...

357
18:34.810 --> 18:36.620
[Zhu Buhua, Chief Eunuch of the Directorate of the Imperial Stables]

358
18:55.800 --> 18:56.540
I am guilty.

359
18:57.430 --> 18:59.830
I will tell the truth. I will tell the truth.

360
19:02.870 --> 19:03.530
Godfather.

361
19:03.960 --> 19:05.020
Lord Zheng has sent orders.

362
19:05.020 --> 19:06.020
You are to lead the Brave Warriors Camp

363
19:06.020 --> 19:09.390
to the Commandant's Office immediately to escort the Crown Prince.

364
19:09.390 --> 19:10.320
What did you say?

365
19:10.330 --> 19:11.060
Lord Zheng

366
19:11.650 --> 19:13.830
orders you to go to the Commandant's Office

367
19:13.830 --> 19:15.430
at once to escort the Crown Prince.

368
19:15.430 --> 19:16.090
Lord Envoy.

369
19:17.470 --> 19:20.470
The Crown Prince is not dead. Go back to the palace now.

370
19:41.650 --> 19:44.220
I, Zhu Buhua, Eunuch Director of the Imperial Horse Directorate,

371
19:44.220 --> 19:45.340
am late to the rescue.

372
19:45.340 --> 19:47.270
Please forgive me, Your Highness!

373
19:50.200 --> 19:51.670
Rise, Zhu Buhua.

374
19:51.960 --> 19:53.080
This is an emergency.

375
19:53.080 --> 19:54.680
This is not the place to talk.

376
19:55.520 --> 19:58.050
Lead the Brave Warriors Camp to clear the way.

377
19:58.150 --> 19:59.010
Whatever it is,

378
19:59.260 --> 20:01.430
we'll talk when we get back to the palace.

379
20:01.430 --> 20:02.560
Yes, Your Highness.

380
20:42.870 --> 20:43.530
Don't move!

381
20:44.060 --> 20:45.460
If you stop making a fuss,

382
20:46.060 --> 20:47.780
I can take this cloth off.

383
20:52.700 --> 20:54.360
Just go to the palace quietly.

384
20:54.850 --> 20:56.780
This is the Crown Prince's sedan chair,

385
20:56.780 --> 20:58.020
the safest place.

386
20:58.460 --> 21:00.590
There are guards everywhere outside.

387
21:00.910 --> 21:02.240
If you make a fuss again,

388
21:02.370 --> 21:03.560
don't blame me for being rude.

389
21:03.560 --> 21:04.910
Don't give me that.

390
21:05.800 --> 21:07.980
My entire family works for the Yingtian Prefectural Office.

391
21:07.980 --> 21:09.390
I've seen it all.

392
21:10.480 --> 21:11.680
You got so many guards

393
21:12.000 --> 21:13.020
to cover for you,

394
21:13.220 --> 21:15.040
and show such a stupid sedan chair

395
21:15.040 --> 21:15.800
as a target.

396
21:16.090 --> 21:17.620
Do you think I know nothing?

397
21:18.200 --> 21:20.370
The treasure ship was safe enough, wasn't it?

398
21:20.370 --> 21:21.590
What happened in the end?

399
21:21.590 --> 21:22.720
It was blown to ashes!

400
21:22.720 --> 21:23.740
Do your job if you can.

401
21:23.740 --> 21:26.070
If you can't, fulfill your duty to the end.

402
21:26.370 --> 21:28.300
You work for the Yingtian Prefectural Office.

403
21:28.300 --> 21:29.500
This is your job.

404
21:31.760 --> 21:34.360
As long as Lord Shen makes it back to the palace,

405
21:34.450 --> 21:35.980
I'd gladly give my life

406
21:36.630 --> 21:37.830
for him.

407
21:39.220 --> 21:40.630
Lord Shen, huh?

408
21:40.850 --> 21:41.870
Lord Shen?

409
21:42.540 --> 21:44.210
Do you really think I'm stupid?

410
21:44.210 --> 21:45.940
He is clearly the Crown Prince!

411
21:47.660 --> 21:49.050
If I'm not mistaken,

412
21:49.640 --> 21:50.960
you must be Lord Zheng.

413
21:54.670 --> 21:56.070
Still trying to trick me?

414
21:56.930 --> 21:58.110
If you want to die,

415
21:58.150 --> 21:59.390
don't drag me down with you.

416
21:59.390 --> 22:00.540
I don't want to.

417
22:09.780 --> 22:10.710
I want to get out!

418
22:11.540 --> 22:11.980
You...

419
22:12.170 --> 22:13.300
You little rascal!

420
22:13.460 --> 22:15.390
You really know how to put on an act!

421
22:18.700 --> 22:19.740
Help!

422
22:19.980 --> 22:20.460
Help!

423
23:41.720 --> 23:43.430
Retreat! Retreat!

424
23:43.980 --> 23:45.130
Retreat!

425
24:28.590 --> 24:29.250
Godfather!

426
24:30.200 --> 24:30.870
Follow me!

427
24:31.080 --> 24:31.650
Go!

428
24:57.950 --> 24:58.610
Help me!

429
24:58.610 --> 24:59.940
Figure it out yourself.

430
25:00.970 --> 25:01.830
Your Highness!

431
25:08.640 --> 25:09.500
Your Highness!

432
25:15.020 --> 25:15.880
Your Highness!

433
25:31.040 --> 25:32.430
Help me!

434
25:32.740 --> 25:34.090
Help!

435
25:35.700 --> 25:36.740
Help!

436
25:38.830 --> 25:40.020
Help!

437
25:40.800 --> 25:43.120
Get me down!

438
25:50.370 --> 25:51.540
Danger, Your Highness!

439
25:51.540 --> 25:52.150
Get away!

440
25:53.430 --> 25:54.200
Your Highness.

441
25:54.200 --> 25:55.630
The bridge could collapse at any moment!

442
25:55.630 --> 25:57.290
Please retreat immediately!

443
26:00.130 --> 26:01.190
What are you doing?

444
26:01.560 --> 26:02.430
Don't mess around!

445
26:02.430 --> 26:03.430
I saved your life!

446
26:05.020 --> 26:06.280
Don't act recklessly!

447
26:12.260 --> 26:13.190
Calm down!

448
26:14.390 --> 26:15.700
I offended you before.

449
26:16.330 --> 26:17.590
Please be the bigger person!

450
26:17.590 --> 26:18.520
I was wrong!

451
26:18.870 --> 26:19.910
I was wrong!

452
26:20.980 --> 26:22.150
I was wrong.

453
26:22.460 --> 26:24.020
Father sent word

454
26:24.460 --> 26:26.060
that all the officials from Yingtian Prefecture

455
26:26.060 --> 26:27.860
were wiped out at Dongshui Pass.

456
26:27.890 --> 26:29.430
The one who is truly famous

457
26:29.930 --> 26:31.330
is his father, Iron Lion—

458
26:31.720 --> 26:33.680
Wu Buping, chief constable overseeing

459
26:33.680 --> 26:34.880
all three divisions of the Yingtian Prefecture.

460
26:34.880 --> 26:36.110
Let me go quickly!

461
26:38.070 --> 26:39.850
You will definitely need me.

462
26:44.630 --> 26:45.980
No!

463
27:00.330 --> 27:01.140
Your Highness,

464
27:01.140 --> 27:03.980
I feel there is something very suspicious about this.

465
27:03.980 --> 27:04.590
Speak.

466
27:05.250 --> 27:06.480
The culprits could've timed the attack

467
27:06.480 --> 27:08.010
on the Crown Prince's ship,

468
27:08.200 --> 27:10.200
but they couldn't possibly have known

469
27:10.200 --> 27:11.500
when you would cross Xuanjin Bridge.

470
27:11.500 --> 27:13.230
And how could they have brought

471
27:13.480 --> 27:14.800
so much Huliu explosive here

472
27:14.800 --> 27:15.700
at once?

473
27:15.720 --> 27:17.250
It's not hard to figure out.

474
27:19.500 --> 27:21.360
This is a trap they set in advance.

475
27:21.650 --> 27:22.890
The person who lit the fire

476
27:22.890 --> 27:24.090
must still be nearby.

477
27:24.410 --> 27:24.950
Search!

478
27:29.650 --> 27:30.430
Your Highness.

479
27:30.430 --> 27:31.520
Let's retreat quickly!

480
27:31.520 --> 27:33.180
This bridge is too dangerous.

481
27:33.460 --> 27:35.120
There's someone downstream!

482
27:49.750 --> 27:50.540
Keep him alive.

483
27:50.540 --> 27:51.040
Catch him!

484
27:51.040 --> 27:51.980
Keep him alive!

485
28:09.700 --> 28:11.090
His Highness said that take him alive!

486
28:11.090 --> 28:12.300
What are you waiting for?

487
28:12.300 --> 28:12.910
Chase him!

488
28:15.020 --> 28:15.740
Hurry!

489
28:17.690 --> 28:18.460
You guys!

490
28:18.520 --> 28:19.650
Come with me! Hurry!

491
28:40.840 --> 28:41.580
Put him down.

492
28:58.780 --> 28:59.690
Iron Alliance.

493
29:10.630 --> 29:13.230
There are still remnants of the Iron Alliance.

494
29:28.590 --> 29:28.630
[Zuo Yehe, Envoy of the Iron Alliance]

495
29:28.630 --> 29:29.220
Envoy.

496
29:29.700 --> 29:30.300
Envoy.

497
29:30.950 --> 29:32.090
With all that Huliu explosive,

498
29:32.090 --> 29:33.490
it still didn't kill him?

499
29:33.670 --> 29:34.670
He got away again?

500
29:37.530 --> 29:39.660
Just consider the Crown Prince lucky.

501
29:41.930 --> 29:42.670
Our men

502
29:42.910 --> 29:44.440
are either dead or injured.

503
29:49.390 --> 29:51.020
If the Crown Prince makes it back to the palace,

504
29:51.020 --> 29:53.150
we won't have a chance to deal with him.

505
29:56.930 --> 29:57.540
Envoy.

506
29:57.780 --> 29:59.430
We can't always be the scapegoat.

507
29:59.430 --> 30:00.910
Stop hovering around me!

508
30:01.700 --> 30:03.300
You're getting on my nerves.

509
30:03.350 --> 30:04.210
Sit over there!

510
30:11.240 --> 30:12.500
In my opinion,

511
30:13.110 --> 30:15.640
it's a good thing the Crown Prince isn't dead.

512
30:23.300 --> 30:25.830
As long as the Crown Prince enters the palace,

513
30:26.590 --> 30:28.390
someone else will deal with him.

514
30:29.020 --> 30:30.700
Once the Crown Prince is dead,

515
30:32.460 --> 30:34.260
they won't be able to pin it on us.

516
30:34.740 --> 30:36.390
We don't need a scapegoat.

517
30:38.150 --> 30:39.150
You are right.

518
30:41.520 --> 30:43.720
Have you found the Iron Lion, Wu Buping?

519
30:44.670 --> 30:45.150
Not yet.

520
30:45.150 --> 30:47.010
Then send someone out to find him.

521
30:47.240 --> 30:49.310
As long as we keep him under our control,

522
30:49.310 --> 30:51.810
things will be much easier for us, won't they?

523
30:51.810 --> 30:53.600
Okay, I'll get on it right away.

524
30:56.860 --> 30:59.080
[Fule Brothel]

525
31:17.370 --> 31:18.150
Granny Tong.

526
31:18.890 --> 31:21.200
I want to take Hongyu away from Jinling.

527
31:21.480 --> 31:21.650
[Granny Tong, Fule Brothel]

528
31:21.650 --> 31:22.560
Without an official pardon,

529
31:22.560 --> 31:24.020
she can't buy her freedom.

530
31:25.190 --> 31:26.300
After all these years,

531
31:26.300 --> 31:27.960
do you think you can just sweep

532
31:28.510 --> 31:31.370
what happened between you and Hongyu under the rug?

533
31:31.910 --> 31:33.710
Do you think I can let that slide?

534
31:33.930 --> 31:35.330
This little bit of silver

535
31:35.540 --> 31:38.070
won't even cover the deficit in the accounts.

536
31:39.530 --> 31:40.590
Alright, alright.

537
31:41.020 --> 31:41.750
Granny Tong.

538
31:42.740 --> 31:45.060
You... you name a price.

539
31:47.050 --> 31:48.290
[Hong Yu, Musician at Fule Brothel]

540
31:48.290 --> 31:49.420
Two thousand taels.

541
32:02.250 --> 32:05.140
[Yingtian Prefecture]

542
32:06.330 --> 32:07.260
Have you seen my dad?

543
32:07.260 --> 32:08.460
Isn't he right there?

544
32:09.890 --> 32:11.910
[We have your daughter.]

545
32:13.150 --> 32:13.670
Dad.

546
32:14.310 --> 32:15.770
Let me tell you something.

547
32:16.740 --> 32:18.430
Why are you soaking wet?

548
32:18.610 --> 32:20.340
Did you fall into the water too?

549
32:21.150 --> 32:22.540
No, this... this is not important.

550
32:22.540 --> 32:23.780
I have something important to tell you.

551
32:23.780 --> 32:24.760
No, I don't have time right now.

552
32:24.760 --> 32:25.760
You go home first.

553
32:26.110 --> 32:28.110
But it's really important!

554
32:28.380 --> 32:29.760
This is serious.

555
32:31.950 --> 32:33.220
Guess who I saved?

556
32:33.840 --> 32:34.840
The Crown Prince.

557
32:35.240 --> 32:36.500
It's a big deal, right?

558
32:38.600 --> 32:40.200
Can you stop talking nonsense?

559
32:40.200 --> 32:40.870
Go home now!

560
32:41.400 --> 32:42.860
I'm not talking nonsense.

561
32:42.960 --> 32:44.370
Would I lie to you about this?

562
32:44.370 --> 32:45.430
Yulu can testify.

563
32:46.010 --> 32:46.740
Your sister?

564
32:47.590 --> 32:48.790
Where did she see her?

565
32:50.390 --> 32:51.450
I brought the Crown Prince

566
32:51.450 --> 32:53.670
from Shangutai to Tongji Gate.

567
32:53.740 --> 32:55.140
Where is your sister now?

568
32:55.330 --> 32:56.590
Where did she go later?

569
32:57.190 --> 32:58.690
I'm talking about the Crown Prince.

570
32:58.690 --> 32:59.590
Why do you keep mentioning my sister?

571
32:59.590 --> 33:00.480
Tell me,

572
33:00.480 --> 33:02.140
did you see your sister later?

573
33:02.260 --> 33:02.800
No.

574
33:03.500 --> 33:04.300
What's wrong?

575
33:04.560 --> 33:05.820
What happened to Yulu?

576
33:06.440 --> 33:08.330
Nothing. I'm just asking.

577
33:09.910 --> 33:10.350
Come.

578
33:10.590 --> 33:11.260
Listen.

579
33:11.930 --> 33:13.020
After I handed the Crown Prince

580
33:13.020 --> 33:14.350
to the Imperial Guards,

581
33:15.400 --> 33:16.540
guess what happened?

582
33:16.540 --> 33:18.370
I don't have time for guessing games right now.

583
33:18.370 --> 33:19.350
You...

584
33:19.370 --> 33:20.330
hurry home.

585
33:20.780 --> 33:21.440
Tonight...

586
33:22.150 --> 33:23.700
I'll guess when I get home tonight,

587
33:23.700 --> 33:24.220
okay?

588
33:25.520 --> 33:26.060
Wait.

589
33:26.480 --> 33:27.190
This man...

590
34:02.930 --> 34:03.790
Your Highness.

591
34:04.020 --> 34:05.820
Shall I have the meal served now?

592
34:06.020 --> 34:07.080
By imperial order,

593
34:07.350 --> 34:09.350
Messenger Director of the Messenger's Office, Yu Qian,

594
34:09.350 --> 34:10.760
is to enter the palace for an audience immediately.

595
34:10.760 --> 34:12.020
No delay is permitted.

596
34:12.060 --> 34:12.620
Yes.

597
34:14.060 --> 34:15.520
Have I finished speaking?

598
34:17.030 --> 34:17.920
I was wrong.

599
34:18.159 --> 34:20.090
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

600
34:21.449 --> 34:22.500
By imperial order,

601
34:22.500 --> 34:25.020
I, Zhu Buhua, Eunuch Director of the Imperial Horse Directorate,

602
34:25.020 --> 34:27.350
is to enter the palace for an audience at the beginning of the Hai hour today.

603
34:27.350 --> 34:27.909
Yes.

604
34:28.409 --> 34:29.159
By imperial order,

605
34:29.159 --> 34:31.409
Yuan Zhongda, Chief Minister of the Court of Imperial Sacrifices,

606
34:31.409 --> 34:32.600
is to enter the palace for an audience

607
34:32.600 --> 34:34.310
at the beginning of the Chen hour tomorrow.

608
34:34.310 --> 34:34.870
Yes.

609
34:35.370 --> 34:38.290
Wear official court robes. No full court audience is to be held.

610
34:38.290 --> 34:39.949
Tell each person summoned for an audience that,

611
34:39.949 --> 34:42.909
because of the sensitive nature of the matter, he must enter alone.

612
34:42.909 --> 34:44.040
I will receive no one

613
34:44.250 --> 34:45.380
other than those summoned.

614
34:45.380 --> 34:45.929
Yes.

615
35:08.830 --> 35:10.230
How exactly did Zhu Buhua

616
35:13.060 --> 35:14.620
teach him?

617
35:16.230 --> 35:17.760
In this secondary capital,

618
35:19.430 --> 35:23.490
not a soul seems to underst and proper conduct between ruler and subject.

619
36:10.720 --> 36:11.840
Stop following me.

620
36:12.580 --> 36:14.830
I'm going to the Palace Firewood Service

621
36:14.830 --> 36:17.630
to find some wood to make a memorial tablet for my companion.

622
36:17.630 --> 36:19.030
E-Eunuch Zhu ordered us

623
36:19.330 --> 36:20.600
that to ensure Your Highness's safety,

624
36:20.600 --> 36:23.060
we must not leave your side for a single step.

625
36:25.900 --> 36:27.370
So you mean

626
36:28.580 --> 36:29.750
what Eunuch Zhu says

627
36:29.770 --> 36:31.000
is an imperial edict?

628
36:33.980 --> 36:36.180
What you just said is a capital offense.

629
36:36.800 --> 36:38.660
For the sake of my companion Wang,

630
36:38.730 --> 36:40.190
I will spare you this time.

631
36:40.390 --> 36:41.430
Get lost.

632
36:44.960 --> 36:45.980
Are you deaf?

633
36:57.600 --> 36:59.330
If that rebel who was shot with an arrow

634
36:59.330 --> 37:01.590
is really a remnant of the Iron Alliance,

635
37:02.850 --> 37:04.430
this madness of slaughtering

636
37:04.430 --> 37:06.140
both me and the entire court

637
37:06.770 --> 37:07.950
would make sense.

638
37:09.210 --> 37:10.070
As far as I know,

639
37:10.790 --> 37:12.640
the last time the Iron Alliance caused trouble

640
37:12.640 --> 37:14.300
was in the 18th year of Yongle.

641
37:14.870 --> 37:16.930
They started a rebellion in Shandong

642
37:16.950 --> 37:18.150
with great momentum.

643
37:18.600 --> 37:20.370
Emperor Taizong spent a lot of effort

644
37:20.370 --> 37:21.660
to suppress it.

645
37:22.660 --> 37:23.350
So

646
37:24.210 --> 37:25.870
the Iron Alliance and the imperial court

647
37:25.870 --> 37:27.930
have a long history of bitter enmity.

648
37:44.530 --> 37:45.360
Messenger Yu.

649
37:51.980 --> 37:53.310
Taste-test the dishes?

650
38:04.110 --> 38:05.040
Sit down and eat.

651
38:14.830 --> 38:15.580
I think

652
38:16.640 --> 38:17.460
the priority

653
38:17.580 --> 38:19.180
is to send a capable confidant

654
38:19.180 --> 38:20.770
to track down the real culprit.

655
38:20.770 --> 38:22.330
The rebels have planned everything meticulously.

656
38:22.330 --> 38:23.660
If we hesitate or delay,

657
38:23.710 --> 38:25.240
I'm afraid in the future...

658
38:26.610 --> 38:27.550
Let me do it.

659
38:28.080 --> 38:28.770
Let me.

660
38:33.500 --> 38:34.910
What trusted aides?

661
38:37.540 --> 38:38.820
Then, Your Highness...

662
38:38.820 --> 38:41.020
do you not plan to trust anyone anymore?

663
38:47.350 --> 38:48.910
What do you think of

664
38:49.410 --> 38:50.540
that Good-for-Nothing?

665
38:50.540 --> 38:52.540
Who is Your Highness talking about?

666
38:52.910 --> 38:54.240
What was his name again?

667
38:54.410 --> 38:54.980
Right,

668
38:56.180 --> 38:57.350
Wu Dingyuan, right?

669
38:58.890 --> 38:59.770
Your Highness,

670
39:00.020 --> 39:02.060
he speaks without thinking and behaves recklessly.

671
39:02.060 --> 39:03.750
He thinks he's clever

672
39:03.850 --> 39:05.770
and keeps showing you disrespect.

673
39:05.770 --> 39:07.230
He is absolutely untrustworthy.

674
39:07.230 --> 39:07.830
Besides,

675
39:08.750 --> 39:10.080
he has already run away.

676
39:10.890 --> 39:11.580
He ran away.

677
39:12.270 --> 39:15.130
Although he has shown me disrespect time and again,

678
39:15.230 --> 39:16.390
he saved me.

679
39:17.310 --> 39:19.270
It's true he saved Your Highness,

680
39:20.460 --> 39:22.270
but he's using the fact that he saved you

681
39:22.270 --> 39:23.750
to pursue his own interests, putting Your Highness

682
39:23.750 --> 39:25.010
at risk in the process.

683
39:25.500 --> 39:27.140
This is unforgivable.

684
39:27.450 --> 39:29.020
But when he saved me,

685
39:29.620 --> 39:31.680
he didn't know I was the Crown Prince.

686
39:35.040 --> 39:35.580
Here,

687
39:36.410 --> 39:37.470
so you don't choke.

688
39:40.560 --> 39:42.020
Thank you, Your Highness.

689
39:42.620 --> 39:43.540
Wu Dingyuan

690
39:43.950 --> 39:44.790
is just

691
39:46.000 --> 39:47.460
a constable after all.

692
39:47.980 --> 39:49.180
For such a major case,

693
39:49.250 --> 39:50.850
I'm afraid he's not capable.

694
39:51.080 --> 39:53.950
Why don't you order Wu Dingyuan's father,

695
39:54.630 --> 39:57.270
Wu Buping, the chief constable of Yingtian Prefecture,

696
39:57.270 --> 40:00.540
to investigate this case?

697
40:00.810 --> 40:02.370
I believe this would give us a better chance of success.

698
40:02.370 --> 40:03.300
In Jinling City,

699
40:03.540 --> 40:05.800
there is no case this person can't solve.

700
40:06.430 --> 40:08.580
If we hand this case to Wu Buping,

701
40:08.790 --> 40:11.950
wouldn't that be the same as handing it over to the Yingtian Prefectural Office?

702
40:11.950 --> 40:13.550
It will only alert the enemy.

703
40:13.560 --> 40:14.750
Let a petty schemer

704
40:14.910 --> 40:16.790
like Wu Dingyuan dea lwith

705
40:17.500 --> 40:19.330
those corrupt little rats.

706
40:19.830 --> 40:20.630
Messenger Yu,

707
40:21.060 --> 40:22.580
do you think I'm right?

708
40:26.100 --> 40:26.960
Your Highness,

709
40:27.180 --> 40:28.310
I think

710
40:28.460 --> 40:29.270
you may not

711
40:29.390 --> 40:30.950
firmly believe that Wu Dingyuan

712
40:30.950 --> 40:33.280
is capable of this important task, right?

713
40:34.850 --> 40:35.540
Yu Qian.

714
40:38.910 --> 40:41.620
I hereby appoint you Right Rectifier of the Right Secretariat of the Heir Apparent,

715
40:41.620 --> 40:44.100
and assign you to investigate this case alongside Wu Dingyuan

716
40:44.100 --> 40:45.560
and report directly to me.

717
40:50.790 --> 40:52.980
This is the token from Zheng Sanbao.

718
40:53.810 --> 40:54.460
Take it.

719
40:54.660 --> 40:55.950
It's more convenient for you

720
40:55.950 --> 40:57.500
to make things easier in Jinling.

721
40:57.500 --> 40:59.870
I won't let you down, Your Highness.

722
41:00.400 --> 41:02.460
That Good-for-Nothing loves money.

723
41:03.540 --> 41:05.430
Just give him whatever he wants.

724
41:06.660 --> 41:07.790
Yes, Your Highness.

725
41:08.640 --> 41:09.910
Did I tell you to rise?

726
41:12.730 --> 41:13.580
I was wrong.

727
41:14.460 --> 41:15.100
Is it good?

728
41:17.480 --> 41:19.440
You only picked your favorites.

729
41:19.560 --> 41:21.000
Those who don't know would think

730
41:21.000 --> 41:22.250
I was treating you.

731
41:27.100 --> 41:27.660
I...

732
41:27.730 --> 41:28.930
Stop being disloyal.

733
41:28.980 --> 41:29.580
Go.

734
41:31.810 --> 41:32.710
I shall take my leave.

735
41:32.710 --> 41:33.480
Hurry up.

736
41:46.470 --> 41:53.630
♪ To know the truth of one's heart, listen to sincere advice ♪

737
42:30.570 --> 42:31.910
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

738
42:31.930 --> 42:33.360
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

739
42:33.380 --> 42:35.100
♪ Swaying along— what's all the swaying for? ♪

740
42:36.030 --> 42:37.530
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

741
42:37.560 --> 42:38.940
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

742
42:38.960 --> 42:41.220
♪ Chasing them down— what am I chasing for? ♪

743
42:41.760 --> 42:43.210
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

744
42:43.230 --> 42:44.640
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

745
42:44.660 --> 42:46.660
♪ Who knows where home is? ♪

746
42:47.190 --> 42:48.930
♪ To hell with princes and nobles ♪

747
42:48.960 --> 42:50.210
♪ To hell with what the history books say ♪

748
42:50.240 --> 42:50.520
♪ I'm my own guardian angel ♪

749
42:50.520 --> 42:52.180
There's a saying at the yamen.

750
42:52.620 --> 42:53.950
Men fear the leg clamps;

751
42:54.260 --> 42:56.230
women fear the finger-crushing torture.

752
42:56.230 --> 42:57.430
I think that's wrong.

753
42:59.460 --> 43:01.310
Pain in your fingers hurts just as much,

754
43:01.310 --> 43:02.360
whether you're a man or a woman.

755
43:02.360 --> 43:04.690
Why do you have a blade hidden in your boot?

756
43:06.120 --> 43:06.980
You won't talk?

757
43:07.750 --> 43:08.350
Alright.
